   "id": "lead-1",
   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "Maciej Maciak (born 19 June 1970 in Włocławek) is a Polish journalist and politician, leader of the Prosperity and Peace Movement (RDiP) and candidate for the 2025 Polish presidential election.",
