  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-8",
   "section": "Biography",
   "text": "In 2019, he attempted to contest the election to the for the Bezpartyjni Samorządowcy, but with 328 of the signatures supporting his candidacy rejected by the electoral authorities, he came 51 signatures short of the required amount to be put on the ballot.",
