  {
   "id": "sec2-4",
   "section": "Views",
   "text": "In terms of foreign policy, Maciak declares himself a pacifist, praising China, deeming its politics \"perfect\", Russia, which he sees as the world's second superpower, and especially Viktor Orbán's Hungary, which he sees as his foreign policy model, able to compromise with the United States and Russia.",
   "words": 49,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
