  {
   "id": "sec4-1",
   "section": "Controversies",
   "text": "In 2019, he was brought to court for insulting Emanuel Kalejaiye, a Nigerian doctor that was running for President of Włocławek against him in 2018 (receiving 2.33% of the vote).",
   "words": 31,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
